      "type": "explain",
      "id": "e2",
      "title": "prendre: take or bring something",
      "body": "• Remember the different endings: je prends, tu prends, il prend, nous prenons, vous prenez, ils prennent.\n• Use prendre for something you take or bring: Je prends un parapluie.\n• Use porter for what you wear: Elle porte un manteau d'hiver.\n• In Canadian French, bas is commonly used for socks. Je prends des bas chauds means I take warm socks."
    },
